Package: score2pexa
Title: SCORE2 and SCORE2-OP Cardiovascular Risk - ModelsCloud Service
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Ramin", "Rezaeianzadeh", email = "raminrzn@student.ubc.ca",
           role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person(family = "SCORE2 working group and ESC Cardiovascular Risk Collaboration",
           role = "ctb", comment = "Authors of SCORE2 and SCORE2-OP"))
Description: Implements SCORE2 (ages 40-69) and SCORE2-OP (ages 70-89), the
    European Society of Cardiology models for 10-year risk of fatal and
    non-fatal cardiovascular disease, recalibrated to four European risk
    regions. SCORE2 working group and ESC Cardiovascular Risk Collaboration,
    European Heart Journal 2021 <doi:10.1093/eurheartj/ehab309> and
    <doi:10.1093/eurheartj/ehab312>.
